        "code": "// Hit several more notes in sequence\nfunction hitNote(key, delay) { setTimeout(() => { document.dispatchEvent(new KeyboardEvent('keydown', {key})); document.dispatchEvent(new KeyboardEvent('keyup', {key})); }, delay); }\nhitNote('f', 500); hitNote('k', 1000); hitNote('d', 1500); hitNote('f', 2000);"
